=== Inspiration and attribution ===

The design of Studio's flag editing and rule building UI takes inspiration from
the flag editor published by the GO Feature Flag project, which lives in the
website/ directory of the GO Feature Flag repository:

  go-feature-flag
  https://github.com/thomaspoignant/go-feature-flag
  Copyright (c) 2020 Thomas Poignant
  MIT License

Specifically, the approach of driving a react-querybuilder tree and serialising
it to GO Feature Flag's query string format follows the pattern established in
that project's website/src/components/editor/ sources. Studio's implementation
was written independently and does not copy that code verbatim.

